[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     104[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     105[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Rows 45–47 exist because C's `sum += calculate_subtree_sum(...)` lowers to
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     106[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `addsd %xmm1,%xmm0` with the **child's** value in the destination register.
