[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     111[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     112[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The other FP sites are not order-sensitive: `maxnmin`'s division is
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     113[0m:[38;5;10m[49m non-commutative by definition, and its two multiplications never see a NaN in
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     114[0m:[38;5;10m[49m their second operand (`param3` / `param4` are converted `int`s, and
